--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CurseForge content — fetched under the user's own key, never re-hosted
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CurseForge files are handled as "replay" provenance: they are fetched per-client
using the end user's own CurseForge API key and are NEVER re-hosted, transferred,
pushed, or exported by lobbify-anvil. Reproducibility of a CurseForge item is
achieved by re-fetching from CurseForge itself under the user's key and verifying
the pinned hash — not by redistributing the bytes. This preserves compliance with
CurseForge's terms of service. lobbify-anvil is bring-your-own-key; the tool ships
no CurseForge key.

